        "pseudocode": "mean_adv = mean(advantage_gap)\nstd_adv = max(std(advantage_gap), epsilon)\nzscore_adv = (advantage_gap - mean_adv) / std_adv\nnormalized_diff = (log_prob_w - log_prob_l) / ops.norm(zscore_adv)\nscaled_diff = scale * normalized_diff\nloss = -logsigmoid(scaled_diff)\nweighted_loss = loss * weight\nreturn sum(weighted_loss) / max(sum(weight), epsilon)",
